msgid ""
"In case that a result item belongs to different branches of a "
"hierarchy it the hierarchical facet might show inactive fragments of "
"other branches. This filter will hide these fragments. It could be "
"combined with 'Show siblings' to only display the siblings of active "
"items. In case of a non-hierarchical facet, all non-active options "
"will be hidden after the selection has been made."
