msgstr ""
msgid ""
"Show all siblings of a hierarchical facet item. In 'Advanced settings' "
"this processor should be executed early in the processor chain, for "
"example before the URL handler and before ids get converted into "
"titles. It is recommended to enable 'Use hierarchy' and 'Ensure that "
"only one result can be displayed', too."
msgstr ""
